WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350
Editing day, the last one for this book.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.830
Check every line of dialogue.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:09.250
Are the exact words inside quotation marks?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:12.200
Is the comma or end mark inside too?

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.820
Does the tag join with a comma?

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.240
Fix each one and say why.
